 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[var(--neon-cyan)] mt-1.5 shrink-0\">▹</span><span>Memberikan informasi produk yang akurat dan membantu pemilihan produk sesuai kebutuhan</span></li><li class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[var(--neon-cyan)] mt-1.5 shrink-0\">▹</span><span>Menangani keluhan pelanggan dengan cepat dan profesional</span></li></ul><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono-custom text-[var(--text-secondary)] bg-[var(--glass-bg)] border border-[var(--glass-border)]\">Layanan Pelanggan</span><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono-custom text-[var(--text-secondary)] bg-[var(--glass-bg)] border border-[var(--glass-border)]\">Pengetahuan Produk</span><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono-custom text-[var(--text-secondary)] bg-[var(--glass-bg)] border border-[var(--glass-border)]\">Komunikasi</span><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono-custom text-[var(--text-secondary)] bg-[var(--glass-bg)] border border-[var(--glass-border)]\">Retail</span></div></div></div><div class=\"hidden sm:block flex-1 sm:w-[calc(50%-2rem)]\"></div></div><div class=\"relative flex items-start gap-6 sm:gap-0 sm:flex-row\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"absolute left-4 sm:left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 mt-6\"><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[var(--neon-cyan)] shadow-[var(--glow-cyan)] relative\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[var(--neon-cyan)] animate-ping opacity-30\"></div></div></div><div class=\"w-10 shrink-0 sm:hidden\"></div><div class=\"flex-1 sm:w-[calc(50%-2rem)] sm:pr-8\"><div class=\"relative p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl glass border border-[var(--glass-border)] glass-card-advanced group\"><div class=\"absolute -top-px -left-px w-4 h-4 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-[var(--neon-cyan)] opacity-60 group-h