 items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[var(--neon-cyan)] mt-1.5 shrink-0\">▹</span><span>Membuat laporan penjualan harian untuk monitoring pencapaian target</span></li></ul><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono-custom text-[var(--text-secondary)] bg-[var(--glass-bg)] border border-[var(--glass-border)]\">Sales Promotion</span><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono-custom text-[var(--text-secondary)] bg-[var(--glass-bg)] border border-[var(--glass-border)]\">Visual Merchandising</span><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono-custom text-[var(--text-secondary)] bg-[var(--glass-bg)] border border-[var(--glass-border)]\">Pengetahuan Produk</span><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono-custom text-[var(--text-secondary)] bg-[var(--glass-bg)] border border-[var(--glass-border)]\">Laporan Penjualan</span></div></div></div><div class=\"hidden sm:block flex-1 sm:w-[calc(50%-2rem)]\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"section-divider my-4 sm:my-8\"></div><section id=\"faq\" class=\"relative py-20 sm:py-28 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\" style=\"transform:translateY(-15px)\"><div class=\"mb-12 sm:mb-16 text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2\"><span aria-label=\"FAQ\">FAQ</span></h2><div class=\"section-title-line mx-auto\"></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--text-secondary)]\">Pertanyaan yang sering diajukan.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px)\"><div class=\"rounded-xl glass border transition-all duration-300 border-[var(--glass-border)] hover:border-[var(--glass-border)]/80\"><button class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-5 py-4 text-left\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\